	(text "Voltage Regulation:\nVout = 4 x Vref (R2/(R1+R2)), where Vref = 1.285V typical\n\nThe 6mm motor attached to the driver requires around 3V (Vout)\nLet's choose R2=10kΩ => R1=7.13kΩ (7.5kΩ is chosen)\n\nVout = 4 x 1.285 (10/(10+7.5)) = 2.94V"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
